{"id":"76daeadc9ac4f409","group":"29","path":"29/29-df-ctl-star-semantics.md","title":"CTL* 的状态及路径真值","display":"df-ctl-star-semantics — CTL* 的状态及路径真值","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)","book_abbrev":"29","label":"29-df-ctl-star-semantics","aliases":["29-df-ctl-star-semantics"],"display":"df-ctl-star-semantics — CTL* 的状态及路径真值","depends_on":["[[29-df-kripke-structure]]","[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]"],"source_locator":"Definition14.28, p.236, scan251","source_basis":"用户 DjVu 文本层与扫描251原图；补齐常量及状态布尔语义"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Descriptive Complexity (Neil Immerman)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"29"},{"key":"label","html":"29-df-ctl-star-semantics"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>29-df-ctl-star-semantics</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-ctl-star-semantics — CTL* 的状态及路径真值"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8cb839e87a64afa7\" href=\"?note=8cb839e87a64afa7\" title=\"29-df-kripke-structure\">29-df-kripke-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" href=\"?note=e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-syntax\">29-df-ctl-star-syntax</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Definition14.28, p.236, scan251"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户 DjVu 文本层与扫描251原图；补齐常量及状态布尔语义"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k})\">\\(K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i&lt;k})\\)</span> 满足 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"8cb839e87a64afa7\" href=\"?note=8cb839e87a64afa7\" title=\"29-df-kripke-structure\">29-df-kripke-structure</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K)\">\\(\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>状态及路径语法集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf S_k,\\mathsf P_k\">\\(\\mathsf S_k,\\mathsf P_k\\)</span>、嵌入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\iota\">\\(\\iota\\)</span> 和构造子见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" href=\"?note=e74e9bfdebb2e9eb\" title=\"29-df-ctl-star-syntax\">29-df-ctl-star-syntax</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s\\in S\">\\(s\\in S\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)\">\\(\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_s^K:\\mathsf S_k\\times S\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(V_s^K:\\mathsf S_k\\times S\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V_p^K:\\mathsf P_k\\times\\operatorname{Paths}(K)\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(V_p^K:\\mathsf P_k\\times\\operatorname{Paths}(K)\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 按有限树同时递归定义。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf1_B\">\\(\\mathbf1_B\\)</span> 为命题 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的示性值。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_s^K(\\top_s,s)\\coloneqq1,\\quad V_s^K(\\bot_s,s)\\coloneqq0,\\quad V_s^K(p_i,s)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{s\\in P_i}\\quad(0\\leq i&lt;k).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_s^K(\\top_s,s)\\coloneqq1,\\quad V_s^K(\\bot_s,s)\\coloneqq0,\\quad V_s^K(p_i,s)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{s\\in P_i}\\quad(0\\leq i&lt;k).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_s^K(\\neg_s a,s)\\coloneqq1-V_s^K(a,s),\\qquad V_s^K(\\land_s(a,b),s)\\coloneqq V_s^K(a,s)V_s^K(b,s).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_s^K(\\neg_s a,s)\\coloneqq1-V_s^K(a,s),\\qquad V_s^K(\\land_s(a,b),s)\\coloneqq V_s^K(a,s)V_s^K(b,s).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_s^K(\\mathsf E\\phi,s)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K,s)\\;V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho)=1}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_s^K(\\mathsf E\\phi,s)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K,s)\\;V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho)=1}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_p^K(\\iota a,\\rho)\\coloneqq V_s^K(a,\\rho(0)),\\quad V_p^K(\\neg_p\\phi,\\rho)\\coloneqq1-V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho),\\quad V_p^K(\\land_p(\\phi,\\psi),\\rho)\\coloneqq V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho)V_p^K(\\psi,\\rho).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_p^K(\\iota a,\\rho)\\coloneqq V_s^K(a,\\rho(0)),\\quad V_p^K(\\neg_p\\phi,\\rho)\\coloneqq1-V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho),\\quad V_p^K(\\land_p(\\phi,\\psi),\\rho)\\coloneqq V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho)V_p^K(\\psi,\\rho).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_p^K(\\mathsf X\\phi,\\rho)\\coloneqq V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho\\upharpoonright_1).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_p^K(\\mathsf X\\phi,\\rho)\\coloneqq V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho\\upharpoonright_1).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"V_p^K(\\mathsf U(\\phi,\\psi),\\rho)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(V_p^K(\\psi,\\rho\\upharpoonright_j)=1\\land\\forall i&lt;j\\;V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho\\upharpoonright_i)=1)}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[V_p^K(\\mathsf U(\\phi,\\psi),\\rho)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(V_p^K(\\psi,\\rho\\upharpoonright_j)=1\\land\\forall i&lt;j\\;V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho\\upharpoonright_i)=1)}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Definition14.28，印刷236页、扫描251，已逐项核对图像中的路径尾部与 until 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i&lt;j\">\\(i&lt;j\\)</span> 范围。允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"j=0\">\\(j=0\\)</span>，所以 until 和 eventually 可在当前状态实现。所有递归调用的公式均是严格子树；路径虽无限，但不是对路径长度递归，故两个真值函数唯一确定。没有把有限采样路径当作 CTL* 全路径语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-kripke-structure","status":"resolved","id":"8cb839e87a64afa7","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-kripke-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-kripke-structure","status":"resolved","id":"8cb839e87a64afa7","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})$ 满足 [[29-df-kripke-structure]] 的 $\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K)$。","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-ctl-star-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"e74e9bfdebb2e9eb","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"状态及路径语法集合 $\\mathsf S_k,\\mathsf P_k$、嵌入 $\\iota$ 和构造子见 [[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]；$s\\in S$，$\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Kripke}_k(K)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf S_k,\\mathsf P_k","display":false},{"tex":"\\iota","display":false},{"tex":"s\\in S","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K)","display":false},{"tex":"V_s^K:\\mathsf S_k\\times S\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"V_p^K:\\mathsf P_k\\times\\operatorname{Paths}(K)\\to\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf1_B","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"V_s^K(\\top_s,s)\\coloneqq1,\\quad V_s^K(\\bot_s,s)\\coloneqq0,\\quad V_s^K(p_i,s)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{s\\in P_i}\\quad(0\\leq i<k).","display":true},{"tex":"V_s^K(\\neg_s a,s)\\coloneqq1-V_s^K(a,s),\\qquad V_s^K(\\land_s(a,b),s)\\coloneqq V_s^K(a,s)V_s^K(b,s).","display":true},{"tex":"V_s^K(\\mathsf E\\phi,s)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\exists\\rho\\in\\operatorname{Paths}(K,s)\\;V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho)=1}.","display":true},{"tex":"V_p^K(\\iota a,\\rho)\\coloneqq V_s^K(a,\\rho(0)),\\quad V_p^K(\\neg_p\\phi,\\rho)\\coloneqq1-V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho),\\quad V_p^K(\\land_p(\\phi,\\psi),\\rho)\\coloneqq V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho)V_p^K(\\psi,\\rho).","display":true},{"tex":"V_p^K(\\mathsf X\\phi,\\rho)\\coloneqq V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho\\upharpoonright_1).","display":true},{"tex":"V_p^K(\\mathsf U(\\phi,\\psi),\\rho)\\coloneqq\\mathbf1_{\\exists j\\in\\mathbb N\\;(V_p^K(\\psi,\\rho\\upharpoonright_j)=1\\land\\forall i<j\\;V_p^K(\\phi,\\rho\\upharpoonright_i)=1)}.","display":true},{"tex":"i<j","display":false},{"tex":"j=0","display":false}],"bytes":2145,"backlinks":[{"id":"bd34a489475a6b08","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf S_k$ 是 CTL* 状态树集合，$\\mathcal C_k$ 是规范 CTL 代码集合，$\\varepsilon_k:\\mathcal C_k\\to\\mathsf S_k$ 见 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]]。$V_s^K$ 是 [[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]] 的状态真值。"},{"id":"38909ffa6d1e85ce","anchor":"ref-137","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[29-df-kripke-structure]]、[[29-df-ctl-star-syntax]]、[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]、[[29-thm-ctl-basic-tc]] — 有限转移系统、CTL* 与基本可达性刻画"},{"id":"ec51b0bd93fa3fdf","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"d5d29e8c675bca09","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})$ 为非空有限 Kripke 结构；$\\mathsf S_k,V_s^K$ 采用 [[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]。$c\\in\\mathcal C_k$，$\\varepsilon_k$ 见 [[29-df-ctl-fragment]]。"},{"id":"cef4708b7fffcfcb","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$K=(S,R,(P_i)_{i<k})$ 为非空有限 Kripke 结构，$s\\in S$；路径及真值 $V_s^K,V_p^K$ 见 [[29-df-kripke-structure]]、[[29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]。"},{"id":"ecc0dd131d213345","anchor":"ref-44","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]"},{"id":"6de56ec38d538277","anchor":"ref-26","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../29-df-ctl-star-semantics|29-df-ctl-star-semantics]]"}],"outgoing":["8cb839e87a64afa7","e74e9bfdebb2e9eb"]}